  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Borlaug Fellowship Program - Regulatory Harmonization</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The United States has an existing Trade and Investment Framework Agreement with Kenya. There are strong indicators that this TIFA could soon lead to a Free Trade Agreement, resulting in increased agricultural trade opportunities. This award seeks to address ongoing Kenyan food safety issues through a focus on animal health.</narrative>
  </description>
